  "title": "Coffee Talk: Dr. Allan Steinhardt",
  "summary": "We have built an active, intelligent, software-definable sensing platform - which we call iDAR - that can be used in a variety of different markets, and we’re enabling our systems integrator and Tier 1 partners to take iDAR and customize it to the unique needs of each of these markets. These partnerships are a win-win for everybody: for the customer, the partner, and for us because everyone gets something better out of the equation.",
